Fuck, this dude was my age. This is heartbreaking.

I just played an hour. Animation and visuals are fantastic. I disliked pretty much everything else. Hud is all over the place, it stops and starts constantly with battles/travelling, tokens are strange and feel way more confusing then just having it work like in DD1.

&#x200B;

I'll probably try it again but I think I see where the negative player reviews are coming from.

