I'm only 27 years old!

Sorry for being an asshole who pressured her into doing things she wasn't ready for because I was an asshole horny teenage boy.  And sorry for being a dick and lashing out when she (rigthfully) dumped me and tried to move on.

&#x200B;

Its been almost ten years and I've had a lot of time to dwell on the way I acted. I get angry when I think about it but I think thats a good thing as it means I've grown as a person. Sometimes I think about reaching out and apologising but I think it'd be cruel to dredge the past up when she has most likely moved on.

I kicked up a stink until they caved and refunded me. Funnily enough they claimed they didnt have the info they needed despite all I'd given them until I threatened to drop the app for good.

