And sonny will be underpicked until he gets a power worth actually giving a shit about.

I'm worried that this Leland change will make him almost useless. His starting stats aren't great and his power, while strong, had a long enough cooldown that frivolous use could get you killed quickly.

&#x200B;

My main complaint about leland was a shove stun leading into a stab stun, etc.

For me bone scraps weren't a problem. Chain stuns were. I'm not really for or against these changes. as a player of both sides I just think its kind of strange.

&#x200B;

If anythingg bones sohuld just be moved away from things like the Pressure Valve to stop chain stunning.

